{"4451760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Russian Roulette with Friends", "steam_appid": 4451760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Do you dream of tricking your friends into shooting themselves?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Why?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Russian Roulette with Friends! - a strategy game of prediction, deception, and bullets! Featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online and LAN PvP for 3-8 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campy FMV characters in a grungy retro 3D world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gambling on which of your friends are going to die</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bomb collars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stroking your chin and sneering <i>&quot;You're pathetically predictable!&quot;</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451760/extras/96e3e691bef2adf1ca2b29aec2c22ddb.avif?t=1788037594\" width=1382 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Russian Roulette with Friends is a game of prediction - getting into the head of your opponents and guessing their moves. Your enemy will load an unknown number of bullets into unknown chambers of a gun - can you guess which? No extra lives, no HP, no second chances - you're only ever one bad move from being<i> kaput</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451760/extras/21c1be85241ddcab803649b39a26a782.avif?t=1788037594\" width=1382 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you're not putting a gun to your head, you're betting on your friends' chances. Guess who will read who to win the chips you need survive the next round - and make sure your opponents don't. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't play too bravely, or you'll end up with a bullet through the brain - but be too cowardly, and that bomb around your neck just might run out of patience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Either way:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451760/extras/85468166bbff0b15e22a1e34badfee4c.avif?t=1788037594\" width=1382 height=118 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Do you dream of tricking your friends into shooting themselves?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Why?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Russian Roulette with Friends! - a strategy game of prediction, deception, and bullets! Featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online and LAN PvP for 3-8 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campy FMV characters in a grungy retro 3D world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gambling on which of your friends are going to die</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bomb collars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stroking your chin and sneering <i>&quot;You're pathetically predictable!&quot;</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451760/extras/96e3e691bef2adf1ca2b29aec2c22ddb.avif?t=1788037594\" width=1382 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Russian Roulette with Friends is a game of prediction - getting into the head of your opponents and guessing their moves. Your enemy will load an unknown number of bullets into unknown chambers of a gun - can you guess which? No extra lives, no HP, no second chances - you're only ever one bad move from being<i> kaput</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451760/extras/21c1be85241ddcab803649b39a26a782.avif?t=1788037594\" width=1382 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you're not putting a gun to your head, you're betting on your friends' chances. Guess who will read who to win the chips you need survive the next round - and make sure your opponents don't. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't play too bravely, or you'll end up with a bullet through the brain - but be too cowardly, and that bomb around your neck just might run out of patience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Either way:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451760/extras/85468166bbff0b15e22a1e34badfee4c.avif?t=1788037594\" width=1382 height=118 /></span></p>", "short_description": "A turn-based social strategy game for 3-8 players about tricking your friends into shooting themselves!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451760/39658bb39048ba84e1cc6b864a6d738d1039fda0/header.jpg?t=1788037594", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451760/79dd51a4cf7bcf0fda66d9207405b25fe96dd703/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788037594", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451760/79dd51a4cf7bcf0fda66d9207405b25fe96dd7